<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Nikephoros I</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Emperor Nikephoros</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Nikephoros I was a Byzantine emperor of the early ninth century. He refused to continue paying the tribute agreed by his predecessor to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abbasid-caliphate">Abbasid Caliphate</a>, provoking a major invasion by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/harun-al-rashid">Harun al-Rashid</a>. Defeated in 806, he was forced to accept humiliating tribute terms.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/nikephoros-i.jpg" alt="Nikephoros I" width="320" height="301" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: АНО &quot;Международный нумизматический клуб&quot; · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:INC-1870-a_%D0%A1%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B4._%D0%9D%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B8%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80_I_%D0%B8_%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%81%D1%8B%D0%BD_%D0%A1%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9._%D0%9E%D0%BA._803%E2%80%94811_%D0%B3%D0%B3._(%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%81).png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
